    q: "Is NoMail as keyboard-driven as Superhuman?",
    a: "Keyboard-first is the core of both. NoMail has single-key actions for triage, a ⌘K command menu for everything else, and lets you rebind any shortcut.",
  },
  {
    q: "Does my mail go through NoMail’s servers?",
    a: "No. NoMail has no backend: it talks to your provider directly and keeps mail in a local database on your Mac.",
  },
  {
    q: "Does NoMail have an iPhone or Windows app?",
    a: "No — NoMail is Mac-only. If you need the same client on your phone or on Windows, Superhuman covers those.",
  },
];
